# The controls of the P1 group: fine-tuned and frozen encoders from P1, trained with the cross-entropy ALONE.
#
# Why: every P1-based training so far (fine-tuned (P1) + JC, frozen (P1) + JC) changes two things against its P0
# counterpart at once: the pretraining (P0 vs P1: P1 adds JC on the global jet embedding) and the JC term during
# training (weight 0.3).  These cells keep P1 and drop the downstream JC, so that
#   FT(P1) vs FT(P0)         the same CE-only recipe, only the checkpoint differs: the effect of P1 vs P0 pretraining
#   FT(P1) vs FT(P1) + JC    the effect of the JC term during training, given the same P1 weights
#   (and the same for the frozen encoders)
# The recipe is the P0 arm's (F_final ft_p0 / fr_p0: FT lr 1.1e-3 with the pretrained parts at lr / 10, batch 28,672;
# FR lr 2e-3, batch 94,208), so the first comparison is clean.  The second one also differs in batch and lr (the
# +JC arms use two views per jet, hence half the batch, and their own S3 learning rates: FT 8e-4 / batch 14,336,
# FR 1.5e-3 / batch 53,760).  The learning rates were tuned for P0, not for P1.
# Like F_final's pretrained arms: one cell per pretraining seed (42, 424) x 2 training seeds = 4 runs per arm,
# max_epochs 40, early stopping on the val CE.
#
#   ENCODERS=rowcol_concat_v0 CHUNK=512 SEEDS='4242 42424' PACKS=4 MEM_PER_GPU_GB=40 \
#   MAX_EPOCHS=40 EST_SECONDS_PER_EPOCH=1250 WALLTIME=2-00:00:00 \
#   CELLS=experiments/2026-10_ssl-campaign/configs/F_p1_nojc.cells bash slurm/ssl_pack.sh
ft_p1s42  arm=finetune encoder_ckpt=@/storage3/DSIP/rriva/research/fm4tag/experiments/2026-10_ssl-campaign/outputs/P_full_20261026_094445/p1/seed_42 encoders=${ENCODERS} chunk_size=${CHUNK} datamodule.batch_size=28672 optimizer.lr=1.1e-3 optimizer.backbone_lr=1.1e-4
ft_p1s424  arm=finetune encoder_ckpt=@/storage3/DSIP/rriva/research/fm4tag/experiments/2026-10_ssl-campaign/outputs/P_full_20261026_094445/p1/seed_424 encoders=${ENCODERS} chunk_size=${CHUNK} datamodule.batch_size=28672 optimizer.lr=1.1e-3 optimizer.backbone_lr=1.1e-4
fr_p1s42  arm=frozen encoder_ckpt=@/storage3/DSIP/rriva/research/fm4tag/experiments/2026-10_ssl-campaign/outputs/P_full_20261026_094445/p1/seed_42 encoders=${ENCODERS} chunk_size=${CHUNK} datamodule.batch_size=94208 optimizer.lr=2e-3 @est=650
fr_p1s424  arm=frozen encoder_ckpt=@/storage3/DSIP/rriva/research/fm4tag/experiments/2026-10_ssl-campaign/outputs/P_full_20261026_094445/p1/seed_424 encoders=${ENCODERS} chunk_size=${CHUNK} datamodule.batch_size=94208 optimizer.lr=2e-3 @est=650
